                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "622f1eb5-da68-3747-9ffe-71d617b9e129",
                        "entry_id": "055bfccc-e959-3477-afd2-b23ecb8d72a4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "небольшая прямая или коническая трубка, изготавливаемая из глины или других материалов (стекло, дерево и т. д.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3159d37-168d-3e5b-b549-8448755b20df",
                        "entry_id": "055bfccc-e959-3477-afd2-b23ecb8d72a4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "среднеазиатский кальян, состоящий из глиняной или металлической чашки для табака и углей, резервуара из тыквы для воды и длинной трубки, через которую втягивают дым"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "65819943-7426-479b-b58d-f9f692d658bb",
                                "sense_id": "c3159d37-168d-3e5b-b549-8448755b20df",
                                "text": "И, прихлебывая чай из афганской синей чашечки, припадая к круговому чилиму, слышим, отводит он душу в рассказах о бухарском высшем свете и милостях его светлости, высокого эмира — да продлит Аллах его счастливые дни."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33697d46-9140-4bf5-b4c4-b175a86fcd77",
                                "sense_id": "c3159d37-168d-3e5b-b549-8448755b20df",
                                "text": "В дым­ных чай­ха­нах пе­ре­ви­тые тюр­ба­на­ми уз­бе­ки ку­рят чи­лим и поют вос­точ­ные пес­ни."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "257776d2-75a3-334d-917b-d5fc336cf374",
                        "entry_id": "055bfccc-e959-3477-afd2-b23ecb8d72a4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "чашка, предназначенная для размещения кальянного табака и угля"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "873594f4-2e64-42b6-b986-9e0d9f0aa17c",
                        "source_entry_id": "055bfccc-e959-3477-afd2-b23ecb8d72a4",
                        "source_sense_description": "трубка",
                        "target_lang_word": "chillum",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chillum",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d48cddf8-d9ba-393a-9134-ad5419f7f3fe",
                                        "entry_id": "780a4647-8998-36f4-9cd9-ee20a01f3e31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A conical pipe used for smoking marijuana, usually made of fired clay, porcelain, soapstone, glass or, more rarely, wood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c7af9dd-18d4-47bc-a837-1dc19669dfac",
                                                "sense_id": "d48cddf8-d9ba-393a-9134-ad5419f7f3fe",
                                                "text": "He could not think of moving till his baggage was cleared, or of travelling until he could do so with his chillum."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e21dc17f-d76a-495a-a518-0b4f534fa519",
                                                "sense_id": "d48cddf8-d9ba-393a-9134-ad5419f7f3fe",
                                                "text": "The votaries should assemble at night and worship with flowers. The ganja should be washed in the manner in which people wash ganja for smoking. The worshipper must fill three chillums with equal quantities of ganja, observing due awe and reverence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bddeb9d-b1e9-453b-b7b1-50bad7e27ec3",
                                                "sense_id": "d48cddf8-d9ba-393a-9134-ad5419f7f3fe",
                                                "text": "Especially for him I’ve kept some hash that I had gotten from another sadhu, a piece of black Manali of passable quality. In my hotel-room I cut it in two pieces — each sufficient for one chilam (a hash-pipe, usually earthenware, in the shape of a bottleneck, that has to be held in two hands for smoking)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4599f414-aab6-30a0-9133-67fedb258c3c",
                                        "entry_id": "780a4647-8998-36f4-9cd9-ee20a01f3e31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The part of such a pipe that contains the tobacco and charcoal balls."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
